{"version":1,"content":"<p>今日（14日）中午1時許，警方接獲報案，指有兩塊膠板從高處墮下，擊中在伊利沙伯醫院徑近加士居道的一名男子。</p><p>該名63歲姓林男事主腳部受傷，清醒被送往伊利沙伯醫院治理。</p><p>警員到場經初步調查，相信加士居道24號印度會有兩塊約2米乘4米的透明膠板意外墮下。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:38.975131+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T15:54:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T12:05:41.410617+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416321+00:00","content_hash":"d2e145059fcf1fa565e4e02fde8a353793da88a2b846d7490dffff9c118b0a7c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}